up to date
exit 0

### EVAL-005 what the installed 0.17.0 cannot do
The gem now installed carries the two defects, so its own `update --yes` to 0.17.1 will refuse the
asset by name. The crossover to 0.17.1 is made once more from a checkout of this change; from 0.17.1
on, `soft-foundry update --yes` is self-sufficient.
